# MSBuild reads this file for every command-line build in the repository.
# Build RMC-BestFit's projects against the vendored RMC.Numerics source (upstream/Numerics, tag
# v2.2.0, the exact source of the NuGet package RMC-BestFit uses) instead of the NuGet package.
-p:UseLocalRmcNumerics=true
# The same for restore: once a -restoreProperty is passed (dotnet build passes its own), restore ignores
# -p values, and would restore RMC-BestFit against the NuGet package while the build then compiles
# against the source, which a fresh checkout hasn't restored.
-restoreProperty:UseLocalRmcNumerics=true
